## File Structure (Main Terraform Directory)

```
environments/dev/
├── providers.tf              # azurerm provider config, no hardcoded subscription
├── acr.tf                    # Container registry
├── role_assignments.tf       # ACR role assignments (pull, push)
├── cae.tf                    # Container Apps Environment + 3 container apps + certs
├── sql.tf                    # SQL server, database, TDE, firewall rules, auditing
├── akv.tf                    # Key Vault (vault only, no secret resources)
├── vnet.tf                   # VNets, subnets, private DNS zones, private endpoint, NSG
├── imports.tf                # Scratch file for in-progress import blocks (cleaned after use)
├── terraform.tfstate         # LOCAL ONLY — gitignored, contains real resource attributes
└── .gitignore                # Excludes *.tfstate, *.tfstate.backup, .terraform/
```
